# Web3Forms access key. Without it the contact section falls back to a mailto link.
# Free key from https://web3forms.com — it is a public key, safe to commit to CI.
#
# Local env var name: VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY (this file).
# CI/GitHub Actions repository secret name: WEB3FORMS_KEY (deliberately different —
# deploy.yml maps secrets.WEB3FORMS_KEY to VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY at build time).
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
